---
title: Deleting a user
endpoint: /users/{id}
method: delete
---

Use this endpoint to remove a teammate from your newsletter or cancel a pending invitation.

You'll need your [primary API key](/api-authentication) and write access to newsletter settings. Other API keys can't remove teammates, even if they have write access to newsletter settings.

If you use any API key other than your primary API key, you'll receive a `403` with the code `permission_denied`. Your teammate will keep their access, and pending invitations won't change.
